"On iOS these rules are kept but match nothing: the owner metadata they test cannot be resolved, so the next rule decides. UID is the exception — it is removed, because a UID rule cannot be built on this platform and keeping it would stop the whole configuration from loading. Use domain, IP, GEOSITE or GEOIP conditions instead." = "在 iOS 上這些規則會保留，但符合不到任何東西：它們檢驗的歸屬元資料無法解析，於是交由下一條規則決定。UID 是例外——它會被移除，因為這個平台上建置不出 UID 規則，留著會讓整份設定無法載入。請改用網域、IP、GEOSITE 或 GEOIP 條件。";
