"On tvOS, process-, inbound-user- and source-app-based rules run but match nothing, because the owner metadata they test cannot be resolved; UID rules are removed at activation. The structured rule editor rejects all of them up front." = "在 Apple TV 上，基於程序、入站使用者和來源App的規則會執行但符合不到任何東西，因為它們檢驗的歸屬元資料無法解析；UID 規則會在啟用時被移除。結構化規則編輯器會在錄入時就拒絕它們。";
