"The controller runs what your profile asks for: the API listens where you wrote it, and the bundled web UI is served, fetching itself once if the app has not already placed it. Two spellings are not carried over — the Windows named pipe, and the routing mark, which is a Linux socket option Darwin does not define." = "控制器按你的設定檔執行：API 在你寫的位址上監聽，內建面板也會提供；若 App 尚未預置面板，它會自行取回一次。兩種寫法不予沿用——Windows 命名管道，以及 routing mark（那是 Linux 的 socket 選項，Darwin 不定義）。";
