"The handshake timeout cannot be negative." = "握手逾時不能是負數。";
"The implicit GLOBAL group can select an internal hop, so changing that proxy would affect routes outside this relay." = "隱式 GLOBAL 群組可能選取鏈內的中間跳，修改該代理會影響此中繼之外的路由。";
"The inline provider content does not match its provider type." = "inline 集合內容與其類型不符合。";
