"The networking core that powers Clash." = "為 Clash 提供網路能力的核心。";
"The node connection closed during the URL test." = "URL 測試期間節點連線被關閉。";
"The node server is unreachable on the current network." = "目前網路無法存取該節點伺服器。";
"The node server refused the connection." = "節點伺服器拒絕了連線。";
"The obfuscation packet sizes need a positive minimum and a maximum no smaller than it." = "混淆包大小的下限必須為正，上限不能小於下限。";
"The open-source core that carries traffic." = "承載流量的開源核心。";
"The platform settles this one; there is nothing to change." = "這一項由平台定下，沒有可改的地方。";
"The platform's own trust, selected explicitly." = "顯式選擇平台自身的信任。";
"The platform's own trust. Nothing is changed." = "使用平台自身的信任，不做任何改變。";
