"The settings upgrade was interrupted and automatic recovery could not be confirmed. Do not change profiles until you restore a backup." = "設定升級被中斷，且自動回復未獲確認。回復備份前請不要更改設定檔。";
"The share link could not be read." = "這條分享連結讀不出來。";
"The shared JSON is what this inbox holds: the system's payload complete and unfiltered, under a small Clash header. Nothing is taken out of it, so it can name your servers and addresses. Clash has no automatic diagnostics uploader." = "分享出去的 JSON 就是這裡儲存的那一份：系統的載荷完整、不做任何過濾，外面套一層 Clash 的小信封。裡面什麼都沒被拿掉，所以它可能寫出你的伺服器與網址。Clash 沒有任何自動上傳診斷資料的機制。";
"The shared configuration is empty." = "共享的設定為空。";
"The shared container is unavailable." = "共享容器不可用。";
"The site you open sees this one." = "你開啟的網站看到的是這一個。";
