"The stored source and effective comparison does not contain a known iOS rewrite." = "源文字與生效設定的對比中沒有已知的 iOS 改寫。";
"The stored source and effective comparison does not contain a known macOS rewrite." = "源文字與生效設定的對比中沒有已知的 macOS 改寫。";
