"The system stopped the tunnel while it was loading %@. It was using %@ at the time." = "系統在通道載入 %@ 時把它停掉了。當時它用了 %@。";
"The system stopped the tunnel while it was starting. It was using %@ at the time." = "系統在通道啟動時把它停掉了。當時它用了 %@。";
