"The tunnel stopped without a request from Clash." = "通道在 Clash 未請求的情況下停止了。";
"The tunnel writes down what it was doing right up to the moment it stopped. When the reason above does not say enough, the last lines of the log usually do — they name the rule set, the server or the setting involved." = "通道會把自己停下前正在做的事逐條記下來。上面這段說不清楚的時候，記錄的最後幾行通常說得清楚——它會點出是哪個規則集、哪台伺服器或哪項設定。";
"The universal proxy platform" = "通用代理平台";
"The update interval must be zero or a positive number of seconds." = "更新間隔須為零或正數秒。";
"The upgraded script would change a profile's runtime behavior, so nothing was changed." = "升級後的指令碼會改變某設定檔的執行階段行為，因此未做任何更改。";
"The upgraded settings would change a profile's runtime behavior, so nothing was changed." = "升級後的設定會改變某設定檔的執行階段行為，因此未做任何更改。";
"The upstream project Hako is based on." = "Hako 所基於的上游專案。";
"The validated source was saved." = "已儲存驗證透過的來源。";
"Theme" = "主題";
"Theme Mode" = "主題模式";
"Then: General → VPN, DNS & Device Management → DNS → Clash DNS" = "然後：通用 → VPN、DNS 與裝置管理 → DNS → Clash DNS";
"These DNS settings have changes that have not been saved." = "這些 DNS 設定有尚未儲存的更改。";
"These choices do not alter any imported profile." = "這些選擇不會改動任何已匯入的設定檔。";
